From 23be2ed85bf75f1a1c808f201bcc44c016d2661a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:03:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] jtbubl netplay: the CRC covers the CPUs' writes
 (JTFRAME_NP_STATE), not the picture whose lines wait for the SDRAM; np_test
 --corrupt
---
 cores/bubl/cfg/macros.def                      |  1 +
 cores/bubl/hdl/jtbubl_game.v                   |  7 +++++++
 cores/bubl/hdl/jtbubl_main.v                   | 18 +++++++++++++++++-
 modules/jtframe/doc/macros.md                  |  1 +
 modules/jtframe/hdl/inc/game_sdram.v           |  8 ++++++++
 .../jtframe/hdl/inc/jtframe_game_instance.v    |  4 ++++
 modules/jtframe/hdl/inc/jtframe_game_ports.inc |  4 ++++
 modules/jtframe/hdl/ver/game_test.v            | 12 ++++++++++++
 .../jtframe/target/mister/hdl/jtframe_emu.sv   |  8 ++++++++
 .../target/mister/hdl/jtframe_mister.sv        |  6 +++++-
 .../target/mister/hdl/jtframe_np_board.sv      |  9 +++++++++
 modules/jtframe/verilator/np_test.cpp          |  7 +++++++
 12 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

